OL,3,GNEWSAHow the budget has split one Black
OL,4,ACountry town
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, Chancellor John Healey
OL,7,Fset out the government's tax and
OL,8,Fspending plans in his Budget ` the
OL,9,Ffirst since Andy Burnham became prime
OL,10,Fminister.
OL,12,FAmong his announcements were a #100
OL,13,F"household energy payment" for 20
OL,14,Fmillion households in England and
OL,15,Fimport taxes removed from more than 100
OL,16,Ffood products.
OL,18,FBut is there enough in the Budget to
OL,19,Fhelp towards day-to-day life in the
OL,20,FBlack Country? The BBC has spoken to
OL,21,Fpeople visiting a West Bromwich market
OL,22,Fto find out.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
